<translate>
==== BloodLocation ==== <!--T:1-->

<!--T:2-->
Specifies the body part that temperature and protection parameters will affect, along with where blood will be displayed on the clothing item.
<syntaxhighlight lang="Java">
BloodLocation = FullHelmet; Neck,
</syntaxhighlight>

== Blood locations == <!--T:3-->

<!--T:4-->
The below table shows a list of <code>BloodLocation</code> values that can be used, and the body parts that they will affect.
</translate>
